00:41:15.335 --> 00:41:17.814
So we have the pretraining stage,

00:41:17.815 --> 00:41:20.014
which any language model

00:41:20.014 --> 00:41:22.175
goes through. We are going to train

00:41:22.175 --> 00:41:24.344
these LLMs on huge amount

00:41:24.345 --> 00:41:26.125
of data, usually crawled from the Internet.

