And this gives them basic knowledge, like linguistic

00:41:28.765 --> 00:41:30.324
knowledge, general board on

00:41:31.365 --> 00:41:33.464
in general knowledge about different things.

00:41:34.335 --> 00:41:36.494
But this does not enable to the enable them

00:41:36.495 --> 00:41:38.665
to necessarily do q one a

00:41:38.725 --> 00:41:40.885
question answering. Right? So as to enable them to

00:41:40.885 --> 00:41:43.125
do question answering or

00:41:43.125 --> 00:41:45.365
reasoning, we need this additional

00:41:45.365 --> 00:41:47.625
post training stage or fine tuning stage.

00:41:48.995 --> 00:41:51.495
So there are two ways we can do post training.

00:41:52.465 --> 00:41:54.545
For language models. One is supervised fine

00:41:54.545 --> 00:41:56.565
tuning, which which shows

00:41:56.565 --> 00:41:58.965
that if we are doing instruction tuning, it just shows

00:41:58.965 --> 00:42:01.365
them pairs of questions and ask And if you are doing

00:42:01.365 --> 00:42:03.285
reasoning, it shows them the

00:42:03.505 --> 00:42:05.925
question. Very long chain of thought,

00:42:05.925 --> 00:42:07.994
and then the answer. Right? So this is

00:42:07.995 --> 00:42:09.814
going to be supervised fine tuning, which

00:42:10.455 --> 00:42:12.574
supervises all the intermediate reasoning steps.

00:42:13.375 --> 00:42:15.714
Alternate alternatively, we can do reinforcement

00:42:15.855 --> 00:42:17.955
learning. Where we show the

00:42:18.355 --> 00:42:20.455
model question We ask them to think

00:42:20.455 --> 00:42:22.615
on their own. As much as

00:42:22.615 --> 00:42:24.855
they want and come up with an answer, and we

00:42:24.855 --> 00:42:26.925
just reward the output or

00:42:26.925 --> 00:42:29.235
the outcome. And this is called outcome

00:42:29.295 --> 00:42:31.294
supervision. In contrast to

00:42:31.855 --> 00:42:33.604
process supervision, which is SFG.

00:42:35.445 --> 00:42:37.525
And one tricky kind of,

00:42:38.485 --> 00:42:40.645
thing here is that usually, it is very

00:42:40.645 --> 00:42:42.794
hard evaluate the

00:42:42.794 --> 00:42:44.915
