Let me just conclude by summarizing. So

03:00:17.275 --> 03:00:19.455
what I so basically, we showed

03:00:19.455 --> 03:00:21.395
that in synthetic simple settings,

03:00:23.815 --> 03:00:26.076
memorization in models is really

03:00:26.416 --> 03:00:28.615
adversely impacted by a,

03:00:28.615 --> 03:00:30.825
having too many effects, that

03:00:30.825 --> 03:00:32.365
we are asking the model to memorize,

03:00:33.115 --> 03:00:35.275
And b, just the distribution of those

03:00:35.275 --> 03:00:37.685
