05:24:42.941 --> 05:24:44.461
very similar results that

05:24:45.341 --> 05:24:47.761
that it's better to just predict stuff in RGB

05:24:48.301 --> 05:24:50.181
in a way that maps the actual

05:24:50.481 --> 05:24:52.591
