to make to create a benchmark that's

06:53:48.450 --> 06:53:50.140
really going to move the field forward?

06:53:50.700 --> 06:53:52.780
So I'll try to go through all of these and give a few

06:53:52.780 --> 06:53:54.790
examples as well. From a lot of

06:53:54.790 --> 06:53:56.870
the benchmarks that have been super successful in

